  "summary": [
    "D1 migrates nine conjecture-local uniformity helpers and the public hg_uniform/hg_uniformb onto GTBase.hypergraph_uniformity: uniform_family (Prop), uniform_familyb (Boolean) and the same-body indexed uniform_incidence for U5. Arbitrary finite carriers; no added guard; partite uniformity stays separate.",
    "Frozen at the C25 baseline: 11 sources, 7 chains (U12 forests/trees, X6 and XE1 extremal wrappers, X209 minimum excess, the natural-valued public hg_turan) and 20 complete current rows, each in a module importing only its own conjecture file. Five complete A9/A10 + D1 Originals (X209, X6 #834, XE2 #833, X108, X225 #01) reuse the frozen cut/degree/dmax modules by aliases: 25 whole-statement iff.",
    "Statuses, legs, docs, the X209 unused-T' defect, U12 edge connectivity and the opaque X225 dmax witness are unchanged. Public client: base/theories/examples/hypergraph_uniformity.v."
  ],
